data: {"id": "ca59df1512334a38-final", "run_id": "ca59df1512334a38", "seq": 718, "ts_ms": 1789111618641, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod内存请求（1Pi）远超集群节点可用内存容量，导致调度器无法找到满足资源的节点，且集群资源紧张（所有节点内存耗尽）导致预抢占失败，Pod持续处于Pending状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_request.memory: 1Pi` (fact-00d61438d49a7d) | 提供引发异常的显性资源请求量，远超常规容量。 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory: 1Pi` (fact-00e407728d2dcef) | 确认内存硬限制与请求一致，排除资源超卖干扰。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending` (fact-00e9e0ff4a453b3) | 确证 Pod 未进入运行状态。 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory` (fact-015bf1800d1f) | 提供调度过失败的确切机制与集群资源状态。 |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition: Unschedulable, No preemption victims found` (fact-00dcd5bfb13d136) | 证实集群全量节点耗尽，无法执行预抢占。 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase(Pending) = 1` (fact-00eda29bd189686) | 监控指标证实 Pod 长期停留在 Pending 状态。 |\n\n调度器事件（#4, #5）直接指出集群无可用内存且无法抢占，这一物理限制与 `1Pi` 的内存请求（#1, #2）形成完整的因果闭环，Metric（#6）进一步印证了该现象的持续性。由于 Pod 始终未调度成功，Logging 与 Tracing 维度缺失属于正常物理状态，不参与故障分析。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod配置内存请求1Pi → 调度器无法满足任何节点容量 → 预抢占无资源可牺牲 → Pod持续Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 `Pod内存请求（1Pi）远超集群节点可用内存容量`（依据证据 #1, #4, #5）。\n\n该资源请求量级导致调度器在评估所有 3 个节点时均判定为 `Insufficient memory`，进而触发了 `No preemption victims found` 机制。集群整体资源耗尽使得 Pod 无法在任何节点上分配资源，从而维持 `Pending` 状态（依据证据 #3, #6）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.8s\n├─ 问题定位: 13.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 31.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 31.6s (Evidence 26.8s, RCA 4.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 53.789, "metrics": {"run_id": "ca59df1512334a38", "mttr": {"value": "53.8s", "seconds": 53.79689598083496, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 53796.89598083496, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 49046.12493515015, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7652.1923542022705, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4409.296751022339}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 13335.637331008911, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 31645.73073387146, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}